{"unit_id":"polaris-smart__dsh-devices#card-zh","repo":"polaris-smart/dsh-devices","commit":"bb8b550ee224b3f79bb7949eeb44dc0292583542","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-devices 是用于管理多台电脑的 DSH 插件，会在会话中注册 mDNS 和 SSH 工具并提供 /fleet 命令。用户可以发现同一局域网设备、使用密钥配对、在已配对设备运行命令、查看或设置远程工作区，并通过 SSH 上传和下载文件。适合希望从一个 DSH 会话连接和操作多台设备的开发者。需要 Node.js 与系统 SSH 客户端；mDNS 发现要求同网段组播，跨网连接需要可达的 SSH 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:35-78","src/mdns/plugin.ts:40-99","src/ssh/plugin.ts:50-179"]}
{"unit_id":"polaris-smart__dsh-devices#card-en","repo":"polaris-smart/dsh-devices","commit":"bb8b550ee224b3f79bb7949eeb44dc0292583542","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-devices connects DSH sessions to paired computers. It offers mDNS discovery and key pairing, remote commands, workspace management, device status, and SSH file transfers. It requires Node.js, an SSH client, and reachable SSH services.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:35-78","src/mdns/plugin.ts:40-99","src/ssh/plugin.ts:50-179"]}
