{"unit_id":"polaris-smart__dsh-devices#feature-1","repo":"polaris-smart/dsh-devices","commit":"bb8b550ee224b3f79bb7949eeb44dc0292583542","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-devices 的功能「局域网设备发现」：通过 mDNS 扫描同网段设备并显示名称、地址、能力和配对状态。调用 fleet_discover 工具或执行 /fleet discover 即可触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mdns/plugin.ts:41-59","src/command.ts:81-93"]}
{"unit_id":"polaris-smart__dsh-devices#feature-2","repo":"polaris-smart/dsh-devices","commit":"bb8b550ee224b3f79bb7949eeb44dc0292583542","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-devices 的功能「SSH 远程命令」：在已配对设备上运行命令并返回输出和错误信息。通过 fleet_ssh_exec 工具提供目标设备和命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ssh/plugin.ts:50-78"]}
{"unit_id":"polaris-smart__dsh-devices#feature-3","repo":"polaris-smart/dsh-devices","commit":"bb8b550ee224b3f79bb7949eeb44dc0292583542","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-devices 的功能「文件传输」：经已配对设备的 SSH 通道上传本机文件或下载远端文件。调用 fleet_upload 或 fleet_download，分别提供本机与远端路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ssh/plugin.ts:116-179"]}
{"unit_id":"polaris-smart__dsh-devices#feature-4","repo":"polaris-smart/dsh-devices","commit":"bb8b550ee224b3f79bb7949eeb44dc0292583542","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-devices 的功能「远程工作区」：查看或设置已配对设备的工作目录；设置时会在远端创建目录并保存配置。通过 fleet_workspace 工具提供设备和目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ssh/plugin.ts:81-114","src/ssh/workspace.ts:23-45"]}
